WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.974
Think aloud while listening or reading: connect prior knowledge, recognise cause and

00:00:04.974 --> 00:00:08.157
effect, use evidence and draw a sensible conclusion.

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:14.251
“An old tree shaded the school playground.” Which detail shows a benefit? Answer: It

00:00:14.251 --> 00:00:15.369
shaded the playground.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.526
Tell a short story, identify an event's cause and effect, and explain the conclusion

00:00:21.526 --> 00:00:23.048
supported by its details.

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:26.469
Why it works: Shade is a benefit for learners.
